#: management/kxmlcommanddlg.cpp:284
msgid ""
"An identification string. Use only alphanumeric characters except spaces. The "
"string <b>__root__</b> is reserved for internal use."
msgstr ""
"Tınıtma yazması bu. Buşlıqtan tış xäref-san bilgelären genä qullanası. <b>"
"__root__</b> digän süz eçke qullanu öçen totıla."

#: management/kxmlcommanddlg.cpp:288
msgid ""
"A description string. This string is shown in the interface, and should be "
"explicit enough about the role of the corresponding option."
msgstr ""
"Açıqlama yazması bu. Ul yazma bastıru täräzäsendä kürsätelgän bulaçaq, bu bäyle "
"köylämä çağılışın anıq açıqlarğa tieş."

#: management/kxmlcommanddlg.cpp:292
msgid ""
"The type of the option. This determines how the option is presented graphically "
"to the user."
msgstr "Köylämäneñ töre bu. Ul köylämäneñ qullanuçığa kürsätü ısulın bilgeli."

#: management/kxmlcommanddlg.cpp:296
msgid ""
"The format of the option. This determines how the option is formatted for "
"inclusion in the global command line. The tag <b>%value</b> "
"can be used to represent the user selection. This tag will be replaced at "
"run-time by a string representation of the option value."
msgstr ""
"Köylämäneñ tözeleşe bu. Köylämäneñ boyıryulğa kertelüen bu köylämä aşa qarala. "
"Qullanuçı kertän bäyä öçen <b>%value</b> digän tag qullanıla."

#: management/kxmlcommanddlg.cpp:302
msgid ""
"The default value of the option. For non persistent options, nothing is added "
"to the command line if the option has that default value. If this value does "
"not correspond to the actual default value of the underlying utility, make the "
"option persistent to avoid unwanted effects."
msgstr ""
"Köylämäneñ töpcay bäyäse bu. Östämä bulğan köylämä bäyäse töpcay belän tiñ "
"bulğanda, ul köylämä boyıryulğa östälänmäyäçäk. Bastıru yazılımı töpcay bäyäsen "
"belmägän çaqta, kötelmägän cığım bulmasın öçen, köylämä bäyäsen anıq itep "
"quyarğa bula."

#: management/kxmlcommanddlg.cpp:308
msgid ""
"Make the option persistent. A persistent option is always written to the "
"command line, whatever its value. This is useful when the chosen default value "
"does not match with the actual default value of the underlying utility."
msgstr ""
"Köylämäne kiräk itep quyu. Köylämä bäyäse töpcay belän tiñ bulsa da, kiräk itep "
"bilgelängän köylämä barçaqta da boyıryulğa östälänäçäk. Bastıru yazılımı töpcay "
"bäyäsen belmägän çaqta bu ısulnı qullanırğa kiräk."

#: management/kxmlcommanddlg.cpp:312
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The full command line to execute the associated underlying utility. This "
"command line is based on a mechanism of tags that are replaced at run-time. The "
"supported tags are:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>%filterargs</b>: command options</li>"
"<li><b>%filterinput</b>: input specification</li>"
"<li><b>%filteroutput</b>: output specification</li>"
"<li><b>%psu</b>: the page size in upper case</li>"
"<li><b>%psl</b>: the page size in lower case</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Bastıru yazılımın eşlätü öçen tulı boyırıq. Bu boyıryulda kiläse almaştırmalar "
"qullanıp bula:"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>%filterargs</b>: boyırıq köylämäläre</li>"
"<li><b>%filterinput</b>: keremne bilgeläw</li>"
"<li><b>%filteroutput</b>: çığımnı bilgeläw</li>"
