#: management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:105
msgid ""
"<p>The command will use an output file. If checked, make sure the command "
"contains an output tag.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Bu boyırıq çığım biremen qullana. Yanıq bulsa, bu boyırıqta çığım köylämäse "
"buluın tikşerep alası.</p>"

#: management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:108
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<p>The command to execute when printing on this special printer. Either enter "
"the command to execute directly, or associate/create a command object with/for "
"this special printer. The command object is the preferred method as it provides "
"support for advanced settings like mime type checking, configurable options and "
"requirement list (the plain command is only provided for backward "
"compatibility). When using a plain command, the following tags are "
"recognized:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>%in</b>: the input file (required).</li>"
"<li><b>%out</b>: the output file (required if using an output file).</li>"
"<li><b>%psl</b>: the paper size in lower case.</li>"
"<li><b>%psu</b>: the paper size with the first letter in upper case.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Bu ayırmalı basaqta bastırğanda bu boyırıq eşlätelä. Eşlätäse boyırıqnı yä "
"quldan kertäse, yä ki berär boyıru cisemen bäyläp quyası. Boyıru cisemen saylap "
"quyu uñaylıraq, çönki ul çaqta östämä köylämälär kertep bulaçaq, alar arasında "
"mime-törlär tikşerü, täläplär bilgeläw bar. Ciñel boyırıq qullanğanda bondí "
"köylämälär tanıla:</p>"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>%in</b>: kerem bireme (bar çaqta kiräk).</li>"
"<li><b>%out</b>: çığım bireme (biremgä çığaru qullanılsa).</li>"
"<li><b>%psl</b>: tabaq ülcäme, keçe xäreftän.</li>"
"<li><b>%psu</b>: tabaq ülcäme, olı xäreftän başlanğan.</li></ul>"

#: management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:118
msgid ""
"<p>The default mimetype for the output file (e.g. application/postscript).</p>"
msgstr "<p>Çığaru biremeneñ töp törlege (ü.ö. application/postscript).</p>"

#: management/kmspecialprinterdlg.cpp:121
