#: kfilelist.cpp:42
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Add File button</b> "
"<p>This button calls the <em>'File Open'</em> dialog to let you select a file "
"for printing. Note, that  "
"<ul>"
"<li>you can select ASCII or International Text, PDF, PostScript, JPEG, TIFF, "
"PNG, GIF and many other graphic formats. "
"<li>you can select various files from different paths and send them as one "
"\"multi-file job\" to the printing system. </ul> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Birem töymäsen östäw</b> "
"<p>Bu töymä aşa <em>'Birem Açu'</em> digän täräzä açıp, bastırası birem saylap "
"bula. İstä totası: "
"<ul>"
"<li>ASCII, Xalıqara Yazma, PDF, PostScript, JPEG, TIFF, PNG, GIF kebek başqa "
"törle biremnär saylap bula. "
"<li>törle yullar buyınça yatqan berniçä birem saylap, alarnı \"küp-biremle "
"yök\" itep pastıruğa cibärep bula. </ul> </qt>"

#: kfilelist.cpp:54
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Remove File button</b> "
"<p>This button removes the highlighted file from the list of to-be-printed "
"files. </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Birem Beterü</b> "
"<p>Bu töymägä basqanda, basılaçaq biremnär tezmäsendä saylanğan birem "
"betereläçäk. </qt>"

#: kfilelist.cpp:59
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Move File Up button</b> "
"<p>This button moves the highlighted file up in the list of files to be "
"printed.</p> "
"<p>In effect, this changes the order of the files' printout.</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Biremne Öskäräk Küçer</b> "
"<p>Bu töymägä basqanda, basılaçaq biremnär tezmäsendä saylanğan birem öskäräk "
"kütäreläçäk. </p> "
"<p>Bastıru tezmäsenä cibäräse biremnär tärtiben üzgärtä bu köylämä.</p> </qt>"

#: kfilelist.cpp:66
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Move File Down button</b> "
"<p>This button moves the highlighted file down in the list of files to be "
"printed.</p> "
"<p>In effect, this changes the order of the files' printout.</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Biremne Asqaraq Küçer</b> "
"<p>Bu töymägä basqanda, basılaçaq biremnär tezmäsendä saylanğan birem asqaraq "
"töşereläçäk. </p> "
"<p>Bastıru tezmäsenä cibäräse biremnär tärtiben üzgärtä bu köylämä.</p> </qt>"

#: kfilelist.cpp:73
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>File Open button</b> "
"<p>This button tries to open the highlighted file, so you can view or edit it "
"before you send it to the printing system.</p> "
"<p>If you open files, KDEPrint will use the application matching the MIME type "
"of the file.</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Birem Açu</b> "
"<p>Biremne bastıru sistemenä cibärü aldınnan, bu töymä aşa anı kürep/tözätep "
"bula.</p> "
"<p>Birem açqan çaqta, ul birem törenä kileşterelgän yazılım cibäreläçäk.</p> "
"</qt>"

#: kfilelist.cpp:82
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>File List view</b> "
"<p>This list displays all the files you selected for printing. You can see the "
"file name(s), file path(s) and the file (MIME) type(s) as determined by "
"KDEPrint. You may re-arrange the  initial order of the list  with the help of "
"the arrow buttons on the right.</p> "
"<p>The files will be printed as a single job, in the same order as displayed in "
"the list.</p> "
"<p><b>Note:</b> You can select multiple files. The files may be in multiple "
"locations. The files may be of multiple MIME types. The buttons on the right "
"side let you add more files, remove already selected files from the list,  "
"re-order the list (by moving files up or down), and open files. If you open "
"files, KDEPrint will use the application matching the MIME type of the file.</p> "
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Birem Tezmäse</b> "
"<p>Bastıruğa saylanğan biremnär bu tezmä eşendä kürsätelä. KDEPrint ul "
"biremnärneñ adın, yulların, mime-törlären kürsätä. Bastıru tezmäsendäge "
"tärtipne uñ yaqtağı töymälär aşa üzgärtep bula.</p> "
"<p>Bu biremnär ber yök bulıp basılaçaq, tezmädä kürsätelgän tärtip buyınça.</p> "
"<p><b>Beläse:</b>Beryulı bernıcä birem saylap bula. Ul biremnärneñ urınlaşuı "
"da, mime-törlege dä ber ük bulmasa da yarí. Uñyaqtağı töymälär aşa tezmädäge "
"biremnärne östäp, taşlap, açıp, tärtiben üzgärtep bula. Birem açqan çaqta, ul "
"birem törenä kileşterelgän yazılım cibäreläçäk.</p> </qt>"

