"Millimeter, Sentimeter, Düym yä Taplar (1 tap == 1/72\").  </p>  </qt>"

#: marginwidget.cpp:121
msgid ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Custom Margins Checkbox</b></p>.  "
"<p>Enable this checkbox if you want to modify the margins of your printouts  "
"<p>You can change margin settings in 4 ways:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li>Edit the text fields. </li>  "
"<li>Click spinbox arrows. </li>  "
"<li>Scroll wheel of wheelmouses. </li>  "
"<li>Drag margins in preview frame with mouse. </li>  </ul>  <b>Note:</b> "
"The margin setting does not work if you load such files directly into  "
"kprinter, which have their print margins hardcoded internally, like as most  "
"PDF or PostScript files. It works for all ASCII text files however. It also may "
"not  work with non-KDE applications which fail to  fully utilize the KDEPrint "
"framework, such as OpenOffice.org. </p>  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  "
"<p><b>Üzençä Çiklär</b></p>.  "
"<p>Tabaq çiklären üzgärtü öçen bu köylämäne yanıq itäse."
"<p>Çiklär köyläwen 4 yul belän üzgärtep bula:  "
"<ul>  "
"<li>Qırlada bäyä üzgärtep. </li>  "
"<li>Şudırma uqlarına çirtep. </li>  "
"<li>Küse tägärmäçen äyländerep. </li>  "
"<li>Qarap alu qısasında çiklärne österep. </li>  </ul>  <b>Bonı beläse:</b> "
"kprinter xezmätenä yök turıdan yöklängän bulsa, bu köylämälär çağılışsız qala. "
"PDF belän PostScript biremnäre dä çiklärne üzläre qarí. OpenOffice.org kebek "
"yazılımnarda da bu köylämä çağılışsız qala. </p>  </qt>"

